\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 Will HAL Core eventually need stronger hardware?\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Possibly, but not because of model inference.\
Its scaling pressure will come from control-plane work:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
