\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 My proposed locked decision\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 HAL will use a tiered engagement model consisting of Ephemeral Interactions, Contextual Threads, Tasks, and Objectives. HAL will apply the lowest level of structure sufficient for the user\'92s intent. Objectives are reserved for durable, multi-step, consequential, or explicitly tracked outcomes and are not the default container for all interactions.
\f1\b0 \strokec2 \

\f0\b \strokec2 HAL may analyze patterns and trends across archived interactions and contextual threads without promoting them into objectives. Promotion to a higher engagement tier must be justified by increased duration, complexity, consequence, coordination, or explicit user intent. HAL may recommend promotion, but should not silently over-formalize ordinary conversation.
\f1\b0 \strokec2 \

\f0\b \strokec2 Tasks may exist independently or as components of objectives. Conversations are interaction surfaces, not themselves the universal unit of work.
\f1\b0 \strokec2 \
That preserves the power of objective-centered execution without turning Otacon into the world\'92s most enthusiastic project manager.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
