\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 \strokec2 Proposed decision\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 HAL shall employ a unified Decision Engine for operational reasoning. Every consequential system decision shall follow a consistent lifecycle of observation, understanding, option generation, evaluation, selection, execution, outcome assessment, and learning. Policies, heuristics, deterministic rules, optimization algorithms, and AI-generated recommendations may all contribute to decision making, but no single mechanism shall exclusively govern all decisions. Every consequential decision must be explainable, evidence-based, and auditable.
\f1\b0 \strokec2 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 I have to say... this might be my favorite decision so far.\
