\f0\b \strokec2 executive
\f1\b0 \strokec2 .\
Executives don't memorize rules.\
They evaluate options, make decisions, measure outcomes, and continuously improve.\
I think that's exactly what HAL should do.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 A decision making framework? It's like you really do know me. I love it.\
