\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 \strokec2 6. Proposed Locked Decision\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 HAL shall maintain an Ecosystem Intelligence Model representing its understanding of the external technology landscape. This model includes tools, providers, models, services, frameworks, hardware, standards, and other relevant ecosystem entities regardless of current availability. HAL shall distinguish between vendor claims, independent evidence, operational benchmarks, community reputation, interoperability, maturity, licensing, and user preferences.
