\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 4. Long-Term Implications\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Following this path gives us several advantages.\
We avoid building a giant prototype that cannot survive its own success.\
We preserve the ability to replace individual implementation technologies without redefining HAL.\
We also create enough documentation that another engineer\'97or eventually HAL itself\'97can understand why the system works the way it does.\
Most importantly, we establish a repeating delivery model:\
