One node becomes exceptional at:\
Planning.\
Another:\
Vision.\
Another:\
Inference.\
Another:\
Storage.\
Another:\
Compilation.\
HAL routes work according to demonstrated competence.\
Not merely hardware specifications.\
Experience improves specialization.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
