\fs28 \cf0 Diplomatic Protocol\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 HAL shouldn't merely "call APIs."\
It should behave like a constitutional state engaging another constitutional state.\
Every interaction asks:\
Who are you?\
What authority do you possess?\
What are we permitted to exchange?\
What treaty governs this interaction?\
What evidence supports your request?\
Has anything changed since our last interaction?\
That's not just security.\
It's diplomacy.\
It scales naturally from:\
A thermostat...\
to another HAL...\
to a future planetary network of intelligent systems.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
