\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 \strokec2 What HAL Knows About Itself\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 HAL should always be able to answer:\
Who am I?\
Who owns me?\
What Constitution governs me?\
