\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 \strokec2 Self Limits\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 One of my favorite concepts.\
HAL should know:\
Not only what it can do...\
