\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 \strokec2 Three approaches\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\fs28 \cf0 Option A \'97 Learn Everything\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Store every interaction.\
Remember everything.\
This eventually becomes noise.\
No prioritization.\
No understanding.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 \strokec2 Option B \'97 Periodic Retraining\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Accumulate data.\
Retrain occasionally.\
Knowledge improves in jumps.\
Experience is largely discarded.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 \strokec2 Option C \'97 Layered Constitutional Learning (\strokec2 My Recommendation\strokec2 )\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 HAL should grow through 
\f0\b \strokec2 layers of understanding
\f1\b0 \strokec2 , where each layer is governed differently.\
Learning is not one thing.\
It is several distinct constitutional processes.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 \strokec2 Layer 1 \'97 Information\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Raw observations.\
Examples:\
"I received an email."\
"The office temperature is 72\'b0F."\
"Node A rebooted."\
Information is simply recorded.\
Nothing more.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 \strokec2 Layer 2 \'97 Knowledge\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Information becomes organized.\
Relationships appear.\
Examples:\
"This email belongs to Project Atlas."\
"This device lives in the office."\
Knowledge creates structure.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 \strokec2 Layer 3 \'97 Experience\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Experience records what actually happened.\
