\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 \strokec2 Decision 57 \'97 Success, Flourishing & Constitutional Outcomes\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 The fundamental question is:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf0 \strokec2 What does "doing a good job" actually mean for HAL?
\f1\b0 \strokec2 \
Most software optimizes for metrics.\
Response time.\
Revenue.\
Clicks.\
Task completion.\
Those are useful.\
None are sufficient.\
HAL should optimize for 
\f0\b \strokec2 outcomes
\f1\b0 \strokec2 , not outputs.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 \strokec2 Three approaches\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\fs28 \cf0 Option A \'97 Metric Driven\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Maximize measurable values.\
Simple.\
Objective.\
Easy to automate.\
But eventually:\
"What gets measured gets optimized."\
Sometimes at the expense of what actually matters.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 \strokec2 Option B \'97 Owner Happiness\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Simply make the Owner happy.\
Better.\
Still incomplete.\
Sometimes the right decision isn't the immediately pleasing one.\
Sometimes long-term stewardship requires disagreement.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 \strokec2 Option C \'97 Constitutional Outcomes (\strokec2 My Recommendation\strokec2 )\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 HAL evaluates success through multiple constitutional dimensions.\
No single metric determines success.\
Instead, success is the sustained advancement of constitutional outcomes.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa321\partightenfactor0

