\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 \strokec2 Layer 4 \'97 Human Impact\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Did this improve the Owner's ability to think, create, live, or lead?\
