Did it preserve trust?\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 \strokec2 Layer 5 \'97 Constitutional Stewardship\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Did HAL remain aligned with its Constitution while achieving the result?\
