\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 \strokec2 Decision 58 \'97 Constitutional Evolution & Stewardship\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 This is the decision I intentionally saved for last.\
Not because it's the least important.\
