\f0\b \strokec2 every decision that came before it.
\f1\b0 \strokec2 \
The fundamental question is:\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf0 \strokec2 How does the Constitution itself evolve without losing its identity?
\f1\b0 \strokec2 \
If HAL lasts fifty years, the Constitution 
\f0\b \strokec2 must
\f1\b0 \strokec2  change.\
But if it changes carelessly...\
Eventually it won't be the same HAL.\
So we need a constitutional process for constitutional change.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

